  "title": "Court Ruling Upholds V2X's T-6 COMBS Award - V2X",
  "summary": "RESTON, Va., Feb. 2, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — V2X, Inc. (NYSE: VVX) is pleased to announce it is resuming work on the $4.3 billion T-6 Contractor Operated and Maintained Base Supply (COMBS) contract. After a comprehensive review, the U.S. Court of Federal Claims denied the protest and upheld the Air Force’s selection of V2X, reaffirming the government’s determination that […]",
